{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radical Zomboarding is a roguelike snowboarding game that's all about shredding powder and shooting zombies. Do tricks, buy perks, build your loadout, speed through the snow, and soak the slopes with blood!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.poster.avif?t=1764087454\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.webm?t=1764087454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.mp4?t=1764087454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like going fast? Getting big air? Shooting zombies? <i>Unhinged loading screen tips?</i> <strong>Radical Zomboarding</strong> has it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic mode: Roguelike snowboarding where you buy perks, shoot zombies, dodge missiles, complete challenges, and survive as long as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen mode: No zombies, no timers, no missiles, no stress! Just enjoy going down the slope at your own pace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge mode: Complete a run with a specific set of rules and perks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of unlockable characters, boards, and hats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New slopes that will push your zomboarding skills to the limit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic cheat codes like the ones you used to play with as a kid!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>And yes, it runs on the Steam Deck!</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547020?t=1764087454","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547020?t=1764087454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/c4a9aaa7c6593eafed83d18bab5f6157b3a486ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764087454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/c4a9aaa7c6593eafed83d18bab5f6157b3a486ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764087454","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3547050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radical Zomboarding is a roguelike snowboarding game that's all about shredding powder and shooting zombies. Do tricks, buy perks, build your loadout, speed through the snow, and soak the slopes with blood!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.poster.avif?t=1764087454\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.webm?t=1764087454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.mp4?t=1764087454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like going fast? Getting big air? Shooting zombies? <i>Unhinged loading screen tips?</i> <strong>Radical Zomboarding</strong> has it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic mode: Roguelike snowboarding where you buy perks, shoot zombies, dodge missiles, complete challenges, and survive as long as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen mode: No zombies, no timers, no missiles, no stress! Just enjoy going down the slope at your own pace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge mode: Complete a run with a specific set of rules and perks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of unlockable characters, boards, and hats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New slopes that will push your zomboarding skills to the limit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic cheat codes like the ones you used to play with as a kid!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>And yes, it runs on the Steam Deck!</strong></i></p>","developers":["CTN Design, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/f9435088fc053d1996c2955bb3d4cec97c6cba4a/header.jpg?t=1764087454","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3547020/120883955/c1cc3c1baa39b7f8a5a4dc465510bffc3f13826c/1764051574/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764087453","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3547020/120883955/c1cc3c1baa39b7f8a5a4dc465510bffc3f13826c/1764051574/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764087453","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3547020/120883955/c1cc3c1baa39b7f8a5a4dc465510bffc3f13826c/1764051574